  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUD-INCA Invest in Capability in Sudan Better employability for Sudanese youth through TVET: Establishment of two Model Vocational Training Centres in Kassala and Red Sea States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to increase the quality and relevance of TVET delivery in Kassala and Red Sea states generating employability for Sudanese youth, particularly girls, IDPs and PwDs, in Agri-TVET and related fields&apos;, equipping them with relevant skills for better livelihood. In order to address the deficiency of functioning vocational centres in the country, the project intends to rehabilitate and empower two Model Vocational Training Centres (MVTCs) in the targeted states, through infrastructural support, capacity development and supply of equipment. The project will introduce courses in line with pre-identified eight trades, through the lens of gender, inclusion and crisis-responsiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
